Maden                             ohne Füße &#xA75B;c.<note place="foot" anchored="true" n="*)"><p><hi rendition="#aq">J. C.                             <hi rendition="#k">Fabricii</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Systema Piezatorum</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#aq">Brunsvi-<lb/>
