<p rendition="#l1em">Diese so allgemein berühmten Thiere<note place="foot" anchored="true" n="*)"><p>S. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#k">Abr. Trembley</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Mémoires                             pour servir à<lb/>
