= 4000. Gehalt (nach                             Klaproth) = 98,50<lb/>
<pb n="577" facs="#f0601" xml:id="pb577_0001"/>
Thonerde, 1 Eisenkalk, 0,50 Kalkerde.                             Findet<lb/>
