birgen                             (§. 227-230).</p>                         <p rendition="#indent-1">11. Lepidolith, Lillalit. (Fr. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Mica grenu</hi></hi>.)</p>                         <p rendition="#l1em">Lillaroth, theils ins Graue, Bräunliche &#xA75B;c.;<lb/>
